 "remarks": "Welcome to sought-after Forest Mews! Ideally located in the heart of downtown, yet tucked away on a quiet street. This updated two-level townhome features a spacious, open living and dining area highlighted by a cozy fireplace and sliders leading to a private deck overlooking the tranquil courtyard. The high-end custom kitchen, ($40,000) showcases quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances, including a range with double ovens. A powder room completes this level. Upstairs, the spacious primary bedroom impresses with vaulted ceilings, sliders to a private balcony, an updated full bath and two walk-in closets. An additional bedroom w/walk-in closet, hall bath and convenient in-unit laundry complete the upper level. Hardwood floors throughout add warmth and elegance. Enjoy one assigned garage space plus an additional unassigned outdoor parking space. Step outside and experience all that vibrant downtown has to offer, with an array of shops & restaurants just moments away. A wonderful opportunity for downtown living at its best! Professional Photos Coming on 10/14.",
